## SQ-CDS-01 | sample syringe
@group A
@commands `grep -E "sample_syringe|Error" logs/kubejs/startup.log | head`; `/give <bot> creativedelight:cow_sample_syringe` and `creativedelight:sample_syringe`; `/cdevtest item`; sampling a cow is the Delight syringe rows' check
@pass Both syringe items exist (the scripts moved to Creative Delight, `sample_syringe.js` and `sample_syringe_items.js`); no startup error naming sample_syringe
@fails `global.sampleSyringe` not set before the item callback (Creative Delight `kubejs_startup/creativedelight/sample_syringe.js` load order)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# rewritten 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): the sampling itself (right click on a cow) is the sample syringe section's row; this row keeps the carve check: items exist, scripts load, no error
shell test "$(grep -c "sample_syringe.*\(error\|Error\)" logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 0
> forceload add 0 0 16 16
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> give qa creativedelight:cow_sample_syringe
> give qa creativedelight:sample_syringe
> cdevtest item creativedelight:sample_syringe
count Gave 1 +\[ == 2
expect verb=item .*creativedelight:sample_syringe
reject Unknown item|No player was found
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
kjsreject sample_syringe.*(?i:error)

## SQ-CDS-02 | CD kitchen tags
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag block creativedelight:oven_heat_sources`, `block farmersdelight:heat_sources` (has the oven), `block minecraft:mineable/shovel` (the six dough blocks), `block creativedelight:crops/farmland_soils`; `item creativedelight:hoe_harvest/5x5`, `item forge:storage_blocks/sourdough`
@pass oven_heat_sources lists campfires, fire and lava; farmersdelight:heat_sources lists `creativedelight:oven`; the shovel tag lists the six Creative Delight dough blocks; farmland_soils has farmland, rich soil farmland and mulch; the 5x5 hoe tag is not empty; the sourdough storage tag holds `creativedelight:sourdough_block` (Creative Delight's tag scripts loaded)
@fails CD tag script not loaded (`creativedelight` `kubejs_startup` tag scripts), or a pack tag script naming the old `creativeengineering:` tag ids
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# rewritten 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): the old boot-2 baseline dumps (perf/runs/rcs234) are gone and the ids moved to creativedelight: on 2026-11-09, so the row reads the live tags with /cdevtest tag instead of diffing dumps
> cdevtest tag block creativedelight:oven_heat_sources
> cdevtest tag block farmersdelight:heat_sources
> cdevtest tag block minecraft:mineable/shovel
> cdevtest tag block creativedelight:crops/farmland_soils
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:hoe_harvest/5x5
> cdevtest tag item forge:storage_blocks/sourdough
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:oven_heat_sources n=\d+ .*ids=\S*minecraft:campfire\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:oven_heat_sources .*ids=\S*minecraft:lava\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=farmersdelight:heat_sources .*ids=\S*creativedelight:oven\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:oat_dough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:sourdough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:cookie_dough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:gingerdough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:cucumber_dough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/shovel .*ids=\S*creativedelight:sweet_potato_dough_block\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:crops/farmland_soils .*ids=\S*minecraft:farmland\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:crops/farmland_soils .*ids=\S*farmersdelight:rich_soil_farmland\b
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:hoe_harvest/5x5 n=[1-9]
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=forge:storage_blocks/sourdough .*ids=\S*creativedelight:sourdough_block\b
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-CDS-03 | CD fluid and fishing tags
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/tea`, `fluid forge:fluid/honey`; `block creativedelight:fishing_net/kelp`, `item creativedelight:fishing_net/coral`
@pass Tea and honey fluid tags hold the Create fluids; the kelp tag holds vanilla kelp and its plant; the coral tag is not empty
@fails CD tag script not loaded, or Upgrade Aquatic / Oceanic member off (the kelp variants come from Upgrade Aquatic)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# rewritten 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): live tag reads instead of a diff against the removed rcs234 dumps; fishing_net/ocean was a biome tag no longer in the dumps, the kelp and coral item tags stand in
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/honey
> cdevtest tag block creativedelight:fishing_net/kelp
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:fishing_net/coral
expect verb=tag kind=fluid tag=forge:fluid/tea .*ids=\S*create:tea\b
expect verb=tag kind=fluid tag=forge:fluid/honey .*ids=\S*create:honey\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:fishing_net/kelp .*ids=\S*minecraft:kelp\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:fishing_net/kelp .*ids=\S*minecraft:kelp_plant\b
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:fishing_net/coral n=[1-9]
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-CDS-04 | mining tiers (harvest.js is Creative Equipment's)
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tagsof creativeengineering:copper_dust_pile` (stone tier, shovel), `creativeengineering:iron_dust_pile` and `create_compressed:iron_sheet_block` (copper tier); `/cdevtest tag block creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool`
@pass One tier and one tool per listed block: the copper dust pile is in `minecraft:needs_stone_tool` and `minecraft:mineable/shovel` and in no other tier; the iron dust pile and iron sheet block are in `creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool` and in no vanilla tier tag; the copper tier tag holds both
@fails Exclusive mineable ran before a pack add (Creative Equipment `kubejs/data/creativeequipment/kubejs/other/harvest.js`, moved from Delight; the 7.6 row says Equipment owns tool progression)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# rewritten 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): harvest.js lives in Creative Equipment (the old text said CD); the copper tier tag is creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool
> cdevtest tagsof creativeengineering:copper_dust_pile
> cdevtest tagsof creativeengineering:iron_dust_pile
> cdevtest tagsof create_compressed:iron_sheet_block
> cdevtest tag block creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool
expect ^(?!.*needs_(iron|diamond|wood|wooden)_tool).*id=creativeengineering:copper_dust_pile .*block_tags=\S*minecraft:needs_stone_tool
expect id=creativeengineering:copper_dust_pile .*block_tags=\S*minecraft:mineable/shovel
expect ^(?!.*minecraft:needs_(stone|iron|diamond)_tool).*id=creativeengineering:iron_dust_pile .*block_tags=\S*creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool
expect ^(?!.*minecraft:needs_(stone|iron|diamond)_tool).*id=create_compressed:iron_sheet_block .*block_tags=\S*creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool .*ids=\S*creativeengineering:iron_dust_pile\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativeequipment:needs_copper_tool .*ids=\S*create_compressed:iron_sheet_block\b
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

